# Spread forecasts: base URL holding firesight-best.onnx, firesight-model.json
# and static_conus.tar.gz (see apps/api/src/spread/assets.ts), e.g. a GitHub
# release: https://github.com/<owner>/<repo>/releases/download/<tag>
# Without it spread reports "disabled: missing ...".
# SPREAD_ASSETS_URL=
